# Copy to infra/.env on the server (never rsynced) to switch optional parts on.
#
# Langfuse (ADR 0007) is off by default: no chatbot inputs and responses are
# stored as diagnostic traces (data minimisation, Art. 5(1)(c) GDPR / DSGVO).
# Both lines switch it on together: the first starts the container, the
# second makes apps/ai send traces to it. Then `docker compose up -d`.
#COMPOSE_PROFILES=langfuse
#LANGFUSE_ENABLED=true
